# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug/
target/

# Cargo.lock is committed for every workspace that ships a binary (root,
# bindings/{c,node,python,wasm}): release artifacts go to six registries
# and must build from a reviewed dependency set (`--locked`). Library
# consumers of datalogic-rs never see it; cargo ignores a dependency's
# lockfile. The fuzz crate keeps its own ignore (crates/datalogic-rs/fuzz).

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/

# Added by cargo

/target
.DS_Store
node_modules/
.claude/

# mdBook generated output
docs/book/
docs/src/wasm/

# UI build output (post-flatten layout — see ARCHITECTURE.md)
ui/dist/
ui/dist-embed/

# Docs embed build artifacts (generated when building the UI embed bundle)
docs/src/assets/*.js
docs/src/assets/*.js.map
docs/src/assets/*.css

# Benchmark reports (output/ is committed via .gitkeep, contents are not)
tools/benchmark/output/*
!tools/benchmark/output/.gitkeep

# cargo-flamegraph / cargo-instruments output
flamegraph.svg
*.trace/
cargo-flamegraph.*
perf.data*
